        <table class="t"><tr><th></th><th>20 层</th><th>56 层</th><th>结论</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Plain 训练 / 测试误差</td><td class="num">42.1% / 42.8%</td><td class="num">70.5% / 69.5%</td><td>更深 → 更差</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ResNet 训练 / 测试误差</td><td class="num">32.6% / 34.9%</td><td class="num">32.9% / 34.7%</td><td><strong>更深 → 不再变差</strong></td></tr></table>
